# Actions

Actions are methods that can mutate state and perform async operations.

## Basic Action

```javascript
export const useStore = defineStore('store', {
  state: () => ({
    count: 0
  }),
  actions: {
    increment() {
      this.count++
    },
    decrement() {
      this.count--
    }
  }
})
```

## Async Actions

```javascript
actions: {
  async fetchUser(id) {
    const response = await fetch(`/api/users/${id}`)
    this.user = await response.json()
  }
}
```

